.TH CHM-IMAGE-INSPECT 1
.SH NAME
chm-image-inspect \- inspect image metadata and channel statistics using OpenCV
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B chm-image-inspect
.I IMAGE
.br
.B chm-image-inspect --self-test
.SH DESCRIPTION
Decodes an image and prints its dimensions, channel count, depth, and mean channel values. --self-test validates the linked OpenCV core without reading a file.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success; 2 for an unreadable image; 64 for invalid arguments.
